Completed and verified.

The shipped family is exact 3-uniform word representation on connected graphs. The co-bipartite specialization was avoided because Section 4, Theorem 20 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.03064) provides a direct construction.

Deliverables:

- [gen_2509_03064.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2509.03064/gen_2509_03064.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2509.03064/selftest_report.json)
